      "content": "The pain and confusion you're feeling right now are palpable, and it's clear you're struggling with feelings of loss and disbelief. Your feelings are important, and it's okay to feel that hope may seem distant given where you're at. But remember, people and support systems can offer compassion, understanding, and a different perspective that might help you feel seen again. Even when the world feels against you, there are ways to find small moments of recovery and healing. Nothing might be the same, but finding someone who can listen without judgment might help you feel less alone and start moving towards rediscovering your own worth.",
      "source": "target",
